{"id":"00033","root":"uni00033_1","name":{"ja":"由利　翡翠","en":"Yuri Hisui"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"由利　翡翠","en":"Yuri Hisui"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":32,"profile":{"ja":"主に前線での戦闘任務を担当する対魔忍。任務以外ではボーッとしている事が多く、戦闘訓練などでも目立ったところはない。だが、いざ戦闘となると忍法の特性を生かし、驚く程執念深い戦いを見せる。そのギャップからか親しく付き合う友人などもおらず、基本的には一人で居る事が多い。ただ、決して人嫌いなわけではなく、仲間意識も強いタイプで、ただ口べたなだけである。その為に仲間を傷つける者を激しく敵視し、一切の容赦を見せない。なお、非常に質素な生活を送っていて趣味等もこれといってないが、餌付けした野鳥と戯れるのを日課としている","en":"(Yuri Hisui, she/her) She is a Taimanin primarily assigned to frontline combat missions. Outside of missions she often zones out and doesn't stand out during combat training. Yet when battle begins, she leverages the unique traits of her ninjutsu to fight with astonishing tenacity. Because of this stark contrast, she has no close friends and usually spends time alone. That isn't because she dislikes people; she simply has a strong sense of camaraderie and is just a bit outspoken. Consequently, she harbors a fierce hatred for anyone who harms her comrades and shows no mercy. She leads a very modest lifestyle with no particular hobbies, but she makes it a daily habit to play with the wild birds she feeds."},"illustrator":"柄あゆり","voiceActor":"疾風はる","forms":[{"id":"uni00033_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[836,1672],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[76,152],"def":[121,242],"spd":[46,46],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","85"]},{"id":"uni00033_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1272,2544],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[102,204],"def":[192,384],"spd":[46,46],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","85","86"]},{"id":"uni00033_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1708,3417],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[128,255],"def":[263,527],"spd":[46,46],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","85","86"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":fals